[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraEconomy/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraEconomy is the economy base of the series: Vault support, multiple currencies, a baltop GUI and a complete transaction log.
UltraEconomy is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Vault provider, compatible with any Vault plugin
[*]Multiple currencies (e.g. coins and gems)
[*]/pay with confirmation above a configurable amount
[*]Baltop GUI with player heads
[*]Transaction log for every booking
[*]Click-to-confirm for large payments
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraEconomy/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraEconomy in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultraeconomy language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/balance [spieler][/COLOR][/FONT] – Show a balance [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultraeconomy.balance)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/pay <spieler> <betrag>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Send money [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultraeconomy.pay)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/baltop[/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the leaderboard [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultraeconomy.baltop)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/eco <give|take|set> <spieler> <betrag>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Modify balances [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultraeconomy.eco)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultraeconomy <help|reload|version|language|log>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultraeconomy.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultraeconomy.balance.others[/FONT] – See other players' balances
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultraeconomy.log[/FONT] – View the transaction log
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultraeconomy.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraEconomy and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder. Works on [B]Spigot, Paper and Purpur 1.20.4+[/B] (Java 17+), no dependencies needed.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultraeconomy reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

